{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-05T06:21:37.676Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"5445f482cb2cfed6ee2872fd","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-05T06:21:37.676Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-05T06:21:37.672Z","author":"pi-glm","text":"Design settled: new gate.ts holds the pure scanner (credential/personal-data/host-path rules over ADDED lines only, sha256 content-hash allowlist with required written justification, fail-closed on unreadable input/git failure/malformed allowlist); unified-diff parser with toon field attribution + jsonl patch-entry attribution; git collector covers staged+working+untracked under the resolved tracker path and excludes operational locks/extensions/checkpoints subpaths. Registered as 'pm github gate' (--diff, --allowlist) and composed into import via --gate: plan completeness + provenance idempotency verified pre-mutation, tracker-change scan post-write, non-zero exit so a workflow can never push on a finding. Reusable workflow_call sync workflow added with SHA-pinned actions; caller example at docs/sync-workflow-caller.yml."}]}],"before_hash":"59f797a8e6f17a1253935f0e83942241b1955f827e303b34179f77feb94ac93e","after_hash":"044358f7928148b2f066ebda13a2815fb02b5d99203de29078ff90b524f66c9a","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"2f1dea2f9d4104d7d13fbb9880da68c0b3db214d3c39f5c7b17b4cdd2d6868fe"}
